# Java `Collectors` — Complete Methods List

The `java.util.stream.Collectors` class provides static methods used with `Stream.collect()` to collect, group, transform, summarize, and reduce stream elements.

Since you're learning Java Streams for interviews, here's a structured reference covering the major methods, including Java 8 methods and additions from later Java versions.

Import:

```
import java.util.stream.Collectors;
```

## 1. Basic collection methods

| Method                                                      | Purpose                                |
| ----------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `toList()`                                                  | Collect elements into a list           |
| `toSet()`                                                   | Collect unique elements into a set     |
| `toCollection(Supplier)`                                    | Choose a collection implementation     |
| `toMap(keyMapper, valueMapper)`                             | Collect elements into a map            |
| `toMap(keyMapper, valueMapper, mergeFunction)`              | Handle duplicate map keys              |
| `toMap(keyMapper, valueMapper, mergeFunction, mapSupplier)` | Choose the map implementation          |
| `toConcurrentMap(...)`                                      | Collect into a concurrent map          |
| `toUnmodifiableList()`                                      | Create an unmodifiable list (Java 10+) |
| `toUnmodifiableSet()`                                       | Create an unmodifiable set (Java 10+)  |
| `toUnmodifiableMap(...)`                                    | Create an unmodifiable map (Java 10+)  |

## 2. Grouping and partitioning methods

| Method                                                     | Purpose                                         |
| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| `groupingBy(classifier)`                                   | Group elements by a key                         |
| `groupingBy(classifier, downstream)`                       | Group and apply another collector               |
| `groupingBy(classifier, mapFactory, downstream)`           | Group using a specified map type                |
| `groupingByConcurrent(classifier)`                         | Concurrent grouping                             |
| `groupingByConcurrent(classifier, downstream)`             | Concurrent grouping with a downstream collector |
| `groupingByConcurrent(classifier, mapFactory, downstream)` | Concurrent grouping with a specified map type   |
| `partitioningBy(predicate)`                                | Split elements into `true` and `false` groups   |
| `partitioningBy(predicate, downstream)`                    | Partition and apply another collector           |

