| Method                           | Purpose                                         |
| -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| `reducing(identity, op)`         | Reduce elements using an identity and operation |
| `reducing(op)`                   | Reduce elements without an explicit identity    |
| `reducing(identity, mapper, op)` | Map elements and reduce them                    |
| `maxBy(comparator)`              | Find the maximum element                        |
